{"lines":[{"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.65226337947338242,"w":0.21604937235514332,"y":0.097383720772020843,"c":1},{"x":0.09053498136177221,"y":0.14389534872856424,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.29218106587727866,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:"},{"x":0.13168724256392503,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"w":0.72427983601888024,"t":"This candidate has addressed all parts of the prompt and presents a clear position","y":0.17432273271133247},{"w":0.68944671630859378,"h":0.018746909600966699,"c":1,"t":"throughout the response. Main ideas are presented, extended and supported.","x":0.12955113204229027,"y":0.19115504041409204},{"w":0.68540374755859368,"x":0.12952661210769009,"y":0.20771269007433557,"c":1,"t":"Ideas and information are presented logically and there is a clear progression","h":0.019131249336808764},{"y":0.22500603704565714,"w":0.66680582682291667,"h":0.015094251598991693,"c":1,"t":"throughout the answer. There is a range of cohesive devices [For instance |","x":0.13163149973764632},{"w":0.67078191121419273,"x":0.13374484734214917,"t":"Nevertheless | Hence | A real life example | However | In conclusion | Thus],","y":0.24263839811486498,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"t":"including reference and substitution [this method | this is so | these messages].","y":0.25826682422644121,"w":0.69971399943033852,"h":0.018144189679580536,"x":0.12956194111713179,"c":1},{"t":"The range of vocabulary is wide enough to show some precise meanings and also","x":0.13154130518256513,"y":0.27307555923853255,"c":1,"h":0.020743746358738879,"w":0.72662979125976557},{"y":0.29013117102965214,"h":0.019494605991107417,"t":"shows less common items [prevalent | hypnotize | tactics | brainwash | succumbing]","c":1,"x":0.13157839386618586,"w":0.73889653523763021},{"x":0.13160325673563694,"c":1,"t":"and collocations [significant increase | catch the consumers' attention | having a","w":0.70386327107747393,"y":0.30616191793495307,"h":0.019949586147133158},{"c":1,"h":0.022057513044916766,"t":"good time together | compare and contrast strategies]. There are only occasional","x":0.13150027426911615,"y":0.32262083766641259,"w":0.71642527262369793},{"t":"spelling errors [bandwagen \/ bandwagon | repetetive \/ repetitive]. There is a","h":0.019158638548654405,"y":0.34074540257313557,"x":0.13362851166512418,"c":1,"w":0.66688791910807299},{"c":1,"x":0.13160568033174949,"y":0.35813365448561718,"t":"variety of complex structures and the writer shows good control over grammar and","w":0.72858678181966152,"h":0.01881404422899291},{"x":0.13364576067341852,"w":0.11336691538492835,"h":0.015325718128217813,"c":1,"t":"punctuation.","y":0.37751155942122305},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"y":0.91569767426017146,"x":0.84156378661177522,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"135"}],"h":3395,"w":2400}